Subject: [PATCH v2 3/5] nfsd: add a generic flags field to nfs4_client
Date: Thu, 15 Dec 2011 13:43:24 -0500
Message-Id: <1323974606-16477-4-git-send-email-jlayton@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <1323974606-16477-1-git-send-email-jlayton@redhat.com>
